<title>USA: Wheelabrator names new chief executive.</title>
<headline>Wheelabrator names new chief executive.</headline>
<dateline>HAMPTON, N.H. 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wheelabrator Technologies Inc said Tuesday it had named its president, John Kehoe, as chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Wheelabrator also named Robert Gagalis chief financial officer and treasurer. Gagalis has been vice president of finance at the company's energy business, it said.</p>
<p>Company officials were not available to provide further information.</p>
